# Chart Quest — security headers for CLOUDFLARE PAGES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# netlify.toml carries these headers for the Netlify deploy, but the game is
# served from Cloudflare Pages, which ignores netlify.toml entirely and reads
# this file instead. Until now the Cloudflare policy lived only in a doc
# (docs/operations/CloudflareDeployment.md) — i.e. it was NOT versioned with the
# code, so a change to the allowlist could ship without the deploy following.
#
# That is not hypothetical here. The Market Identity System fetches live prices
# from api.coinbase.com; if connect-src omits it, every market silently falls
# back to its build-time anchor WHILE THE HUD STILL SAYS "live". The failure is
# invisible locally, because the dev server sends no CSP at all.
#
# RULE: any new outbound host must be added HERE and in netlify.toml in the same
# commit. Keep the two policies identical.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------#
# NOT THE FILE THAT SHIPS. Cloudflare Pages reads `_headers` from its output directory, which is
# `website/` — see website/_headers, which is the live policy and carries the full rationale.
# This copy is kept in step so that pointing the output directory at the repo root could never
# silently regress the policy. Two bugs were fixed here on 2026-08-05, both of which would have
# broken the site had this file ever been applied:
#   • X-Frame-Options DENY / frame-ancestors 'none' → play.html iframes game.html SAME-ORIGIN.
#   • font-src 'self' → the Google Fonts stylesheet loads its font FILES from fonts.gstatic.com.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co https://api.coinbase.com https://api.binance.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://*.cloudflareinsights.com; img-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; frame-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
